  "change_note": "Desktop pin to Core #216: dependency installation security fixes and refreshed Desktop/Runtime component manifests; Runtime IPC, bridge/occurrence identities and the 12 public commands remain unchanged. Core #215 canonical class-ID source fencing and teacher draft readback are preserved. Same-ID cross-class timetable changes are held; unbound legacy rows remain separate until teacher confirmation. A stopped isolated Windows Safe Mode canary retains native root admission for owner-control and teacher readback, while autonomous G1 still requires the current exact class/subject/source grant and durable model budget. Direct Core CLI canary is unsupported. G2 and G3/G4 Live remain activation_pending outside separately permitted canaries. G5 recipients, unconfirmed material evidence, and term/lesson attribution remain unverified; external_send=false."
